  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Adding a force respawn option to the instance moderation tools would be a good addition to the instance moderation tools. Being able to force respawn people as an instance owner or group admin would be good for various situations, including but not limited to:\n\nKicking AFK people back to spawn in a game world\n\nKicking people out of private conversations between group admins\n\nKicking people out of private areas in general\n\nI believe it'd work better as for slight issues like these kicking is too harsh and just using the default warn option isn't effective enough in cases such as what was listed above.",
